 a game without  petty street crimes millennia is without  a doubt the hardest boss in elden ring  so how does she fare when pitted against  every other major boss in the game the  answer very well soul's boring content  creator garden of eyes has created a mod  that pits the game's various bosses  against one another and it's clear in a  new video from the creator that  millennia is a cut above the rest there  are however a few bosses that give  millennia a run for her money largely  towards the end of the game we won't  spoil which bosses prove to be a  challenge or if any of them actually  managed to defeat millennia but it's fun  to see some of eldon ring's most  challenging enemies also struggle with  the same enemy that has seen players  resort to summoning help like let me  solo her in order to overcome and before  we close out i wanted to remind you to  mark your calendars because fall guys is  finally heading to xbox and nintendo  switch on june 1st and the game is  adopting a free to play business model  full cross play and cross progression  will be supported across xbox and switch  as well as ps4 and ps5 thanks to the  game using epic's online services this  news got a little overshadowed by the  playstation plus news yesterday but it's  still very exciting nonetheless i can't  wait to jump back in and watch my  brother-in-law experience it for the  first time let me know if this june will  be your first time playing fall guys or  if you're a lapsed player like me and  i'll see you tomorrow  [Music]
 

